anarchocapitalist system, the communes themselves don't have to be 
free. Quite a number of people might actually contract with a totalitarian PPL
that imposes control on a number of areas of their lives. For instance, a
Christian Coalition PPL.

   The internet itself is the anarchy. The lists are the communes. You
are mistakenly assuming that this list is trying to pass itself off as
an anarchocapitalist society. That's ruled out by the nature of the list.
